\ Dogfood: Phase 4 slice 7b (capturing closures). A dispatch table of two
\ same-frame capturing closures (T-dispatch's shape): each closure captures
\ the shared frame borrow `r = &arr` and reads a different element, stored
\ into distinct array slots (in-frame boundaries, R21) and indexed-and-`call`ed.
\ Its hand-spliced twin `examples/capturing_dispatch_hand.sth` reads the same
\ elements directly with no closure at all; the golden pins both to the same
\ output.

import: intrinsics * ;
import: hosted::show | . | ;

: seed ( -- [ -- i64 ] ) [ 0 ] ;

: main ( -- )
  7 3 fill | arr |
  &!arr 1 >usize &!> 8 !
  &!arr 2 >usize &!> 9 !
  &arr | r |
  seed 3 fill | tbl |
  &!tbl 0 >usize &!> [ r 0 >usize &> @ ] !
  &!tbl 1 >usize &!> [ r 1 >usize &> @ ] !
  &!tbl 2 >usize &!> [ r 2 >usize &> @ ] !
  &tbl 0 &> @ call .
  &tbl 1 &> @ call .
  &tbl 2 &> @ call .
  tbl drop
  arr drop ;
